# Everything a Docker build doesn't need. Local build output must never reach an image: bin/obj hold
# Windows paths and Debug files.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
.git/
.claude/
docs/
**/*.md
**/Dockerfile
**/*Tests/

# Development-only settings (local passwords, JWT key). Containers get theirs from environment variables.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/launchSettings.json
